  "notes": "Artificial Analysis LLM leaderboard read 2026-10-07 by direct curl: the HTML table plus the embedded Next.js payload (696 model rows) give float Intelligence Index v4.3.2 values and cost per Intelligence Index task. Same-snapshot rows for every non-estimated, non-Haiku-5.5 catalog model on the board, with the label's own effort. Claude 'Default Fallback' labels are AA's adaptive-reasoning fallback setting and are not repeated per row. AA did not state a pre-release deployment on this page; the earlier Sonnet 5.5 launch-day pre-release caveat (2026-09-28) is not repeated here. Claude Haiku 5.5 rows on the same board are recorded by the Haiku lanes. Rows are comparable:false (AA harness). DE-DUPLICATED against performance/artificial-analysis-claude-haiku-5-5-2026-10-07.json (Haiku lane, same board read the same day): 36 rows with identical model, effort and value are stored only there (claude-opus-5-5/max, claude-opus-5-5/xhigh, claude-opus-5-5/high, claude-opus-5-5/medium, claude-opus-5-5/low, claude-sonnet-5-5/max, claude-sonnet-5-5/xhigh, claude-sonnet-5-5/high, claude-sonnet-5-5/medium, claude-sonnet-5-5/low, claude-fable-5-1/max, claude-fable-5-1/xhigh, claude-fable-5-1/high, claude-fable-5-1/medium, claude-fable-5-1/low, gpt-6-astra/max, gpt-6-astra/xhigh, gpt-6-astra/high, gpt-6-astra/medium, gpt-6-astra/low, gpt-6.1-sol/max, gpt-6.1-sol/xhigh, gpt-6.1-sol/high, gpt-6.1-sol/medium, gpt-6.1-sol/low, gpt-6-luna/max, gpt-6-luna/xhigh, gpt-6-luna/high, gpt-6-luna/medium, gpt-6-luna/low, grok-4.7/xhigh, muse-spark-1-3/max, glm-5.3/max, mimo-v2.6-pro, mimo-v2.6-flash, deepseek-v4-1-flash/max). This file keeps the rows that file lacks; the claims below still quote the full ladder.",
